@switch INTERACT_VERB
@case "look"
	The lever is currently set to OFF.
@case "pull" | "push" | "flip" | "activate"
	You pushed the lever.
@case "throw rock at"
	DIRECT HIT!
@case "throw tissue at"
	It blew back at your face.
@case "throw fishpole at" | "throw idol at" | "throw potion at" | "throw fish at" | "throw sword at" | "throw coin at"
	You decided it would be highly, HIGHLY counterproductive to throw that.
@case else
	Cannot do.
